m11:C217347.C222329 a m11:Element ;
    skos:definition "Description of medicinal products that are administered to each clinical trial participant, regardless of randomisation group, a) to treat the indication which is the object of the study, or b) required in the protocol as part of standard care for a condition that is not the indication under investigation, and is relevant for the clinical trial design. (CDISC Glossary)"@en ;
    skos:exactMatch evs:C217347.C222329 ;
    skos:inScheme m11:C217347 ;
    skos:prefLabel "Background Trial Intervention"@en ;
